  "body": "### Added\r\n- `ZIMFW_VENDOR` build variable for package maintainers. When set, `zimfw info` shows it next to the version, and the version check and the `check-version` and `upgrade` actions are disabled.\r\n\r\n### Changed\r\n- Make zimfw.zsh build reproducible, by not showing the build time and the previous commit in `zimfw info` anymore.\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n- `clean-compiled` and the detection of default initialization files ignoring symlinked directories and files.\r\n- `uninstall` deleting a module still in use, because it compared paths without resolving symlinks.\r\n- `${HOME}` being replaced in the middle of paths in init.zsh.\r\n"
